    "title": "Michael B. Jordan's Parents, Michael A. and Donna Jordan, Played Key Role in His Rise to Stardom - Santa Ana Today",
    "text": "Mar. 15, 2026 at 9:40pm Got story updates? Submit your updates here. ›Michael B. Jordan continued living with his parents, Michael A. and Donna Jordan, even after finding success in Hollywood. Though neither of his parents had experience in the entertainment industry, it was his mom Donna who encouraged him to get into the business at a young age. The actor has said he's \"really thankful\" for all the sacrifices his parents made to support his career, which has included them appearing alongside him on red carpets and in a fashion campaign. Why it matters Michael B. Jordan's close relationship with his parents, especially his mom Donna, provides insight into the support system that has helped propel him to stardom. His story highlights how family can play a crucial role in an actor's journey, even as they achieve major success in Hollywood. The details Michael B. Jordan was born in Santa Ana, California, but his family moved to Newark, New Jersey when he was a toddler. His father, Michael A. Jordan, worked as a supervisor at John F. Kennedy Airport and later started a catering business, while his mother, Donna Jordan, worked as a guidance counselor and teacher. Despite having no experience in the entertainment industry, Donna was the one who encouraged her son to get into modeling and acting at a young age. This led to Michael B. booking jobs like commercials and roles on shows like The Cosby Show and The Sopranos. Even after becoming a successful actor, Michael B. continued living with his parents until a few years ago, when he finally moved out but remained close by. Michael B. Jordan was born in Santa Ana, California.The Jordan family moved to Newark, New Jersey when Michael B. was a toddler.Michael B. started booking modeling and acting jobs as a child, encouraged by his mother Donna.In 2020, Michael B. was named PEOPLE's Sexiest Man Alive.In 2025, Michael B.'s film Sinners received a record-breaking 16 Oscar nominations. The players Michael B. JordanAn American actor who has starred in films such as Fruitvale Station, Creed, and Black Panther.Michael A. JordanMichael B. Jordan's father, who worked as a supervisor at John F. Kennedy Airport and later started a catering business.Donna JordanMichael B. Jordan's mother, who worked as a guidance counselor and teacher and encouraged her son to pursue acting from a young age. Got photos? Submit your photos here. › What they’re saying “The women in my family are proud of this one.”— Michael B. Jordan“I'm just grateful. Honestly, it's like they all have had such an impact on me and who I am and how I approach each day. Without that, a lot of things about me just wouldn't be the same. So it all comes back to that foundation. I'm really thankful for that.”— Michael B. Jordan“The reason why I'm even in this industry and why I'm acting at all — why that was even an idea. To talk to the woman who started it all first meant the world.”— Michael B. Jordan The takeaway Michael B. Jordan's close relationship with his parents, especially his mother Donna, highlights the crucial role that family can play in supporting an actor's journey to stardom, even as they achieve major success in Hollywood. His story shows how a strong support system at home can help nurture and sustain a creative career.",
